# The mediacore.log scope's series (05-logging §9, 05-metrics §6 item 5):
# family<TAB>type<TAB>labels, checked by metricstest.AssertSeries in
# TestLogMetrics_SeriesGolden. The journal's two families read the journal
# tap's counters (F5-15) and observe 0 until a tap is wired in.
mediacore_log_dropped_total	counter	sink
mediacore_log_journal_lag_seconds	gauge	
mediacore_log_journal_write_errors_total	counter	
mediacore_log_records_total	counter	level,module
mediacore_log_redactions_total	counter	kind
